{
  "sn35.106:0.1": "Linked Discourses 35.106 ",
  "sn35.106:0.2": "11. Sanctuary from the Yoke ",
  "sn35.106:0.3": "The Origin of Suffering ",
  "sn35.106:1.1": "“Mendicants, I will teach you the origin and disappearance of suffering. ",
  "sn35.106:1.2": "Listen … ",
  "sn35.106:1.3": "And what, mendicants, is the origin of suffering? ",
  "sn35.106:1.4": "Eye consciousness arises dependent on the eye and sights. The meeting of the three is contact. ",
  "sn35.106:1.5": "Contact is a requirement for feeling. ",
  "sn35.106:1.6": "Feeling is a requirement for craving. ",
  "sn35.106:1.7": "This is the origin of suffering … ",
  "sn35.106:1.8": "",
  "sn35.106:1.9": "",
  "sn35.106:1.10": "",
  "sn35.106:1.11": "Mind consciousness arises dependent on the mind and ideas. ",
  "sn35.106:1.12": "The meeting of the three is contact. ",
  "sn35.106:1.13": "Contact is a requirement for feeling. ",
  "sn35.106:1.14": "Feeling is a requirement for craving. ",
  "sn35.106:1.15": "This is the origin of suffering. ",
  "sn35.106:2.1": "And what is the disappearance of suffering? ",
  "sn35.106:2.2": "Eye consciousness arises dependent on the eye and sights. The meeting of the three is contact. ",
  "sn35.106:2.3": "Contact is a requirement for feeling. ",
  "sn35.106:2.4": "Feeling is a requirement for craving. ",
  "sn35.106:2.5": "When that craving fades away and ceases with no residue left behind, grasping ceases. ",
  "sn35.106:2.6": "When grasping ceases, continued existence ceases. ",
